  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the person in the image",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'person' as the implied subject of the joke 'i got such bad gas'. The somber expression of the person is juxtaposed with the vulgar text, creating a semiotic projection where the viewer is invited to imagine themselves as the person experiencing the bad gas, even though the context is horrifically inappropriate and trivializes historical trauma. This projection is implicit, not explicit, but it is a core part of the meme's mechanism of shock humor.",
